{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16744","headline":"塞上曲 · 于鹄","name":"塞上曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行人朝走马，直走蓟城傍。\n蓟城通汉北，万里别吴乡。\n海上一烽火，沙中百战场。\n军书发上郡，春色度河阳。\n嫋嫋汉宫柳，青青胡地桑。\n琵琶出塞曲，横笛断君肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}